  "title": "Drake Ties JAY-Z & Taylor Swift for Billboard No. 1 Album Record",
  "htmlContent": "The Billboard 200 has been topped by PARTYNEXTDOOR and Drake with their highly anticipated collaborative album, $ome $exy $ongs 4 U, debuting at No. 1 on the chart dated March 1, 2025. <a href=\"https://www.billboard.com/lists/drake-ties-jay-z-taylor-swift-most-no1s-soloists-billboard-200/heres-a-look-at-the-acts-with-at-least-10-no-1s-on-the-billboard-200-since-the-list-began-publishing-on-a-regular-weekly-basis-in-march-1956/\">This is the first chart-topping album</a> for PARTYNEXTDOOR, while Drake reaches his 14th number one. He became one of the most influential artists in Billboard history by solidifying his status.\n<h1>Drake Ties JAY-Z and Taylor Swift in Billboard History</h1>\nWith $ome $exy $ongs 4 U reaching the top, Drake now ties JAY-Z and Taylor Swift for the most No. 1 albums among solo artists with 14. It is the only act that has a higher Billboard 200 number. With 19, The Beatles hold the all-time record and come in first place. Drake's dominance in hip-hop and R&amp;B has been maintained since his first Billboard 200 chart-topper, Thank Me Later, in 2010. His joint projects have been successful, with $ome $exy $ongs 4 U being his third to reach No. 1, after What a Time to Be Alive with Future (2015), and Her Loss with 21 Savage (2022).\n<h1>How <em data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1261\">$ome $exy $ongs 4 U</em> Took Over the Charts</h1>\nThe album, which was teased for months before its official announcement on February 3, 2025, finally arrived on February 14, just in time for Valentine's Day. Massive streaming numbers contributed significantly to the success of the project. 1 debut. The Billboard 200 chart measures the most popular albums in the U.S. based on a combination of album sales, track equivalent albums (TEA), and streaming equivalent albums (SEA), compiled by Luminate. The meaning of each unit is:\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"flex-1 overflow-hidden @container/thread translate-y-[2rem] -mt-[2rem] pb-[1.5rem]\">\n<div class=\"relative h-full\">\n<div class=\"flex h-full flex-col overflow-y-auto [scrollbar-gutter:stable]\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm md:pb-9\"><article class=\"w-full text-token-text-primary focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-[-4px]\" dir=\"auto\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-155\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\">\n<div class=\"m-auto text-base py-[18px] px-6\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 md:max-w-3xl lg:max-w-[40rem] xl:max-w-[48rem]\">\n<div class=\"group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn @xs/thread:px-0 @sm/thread:px-1.5 @md/thread:px-4\">\n<div class=\"flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words text-start [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"dd59c344-5196-4378-8a14-65040c544cb9\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\">\n<ul data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1927\">\n \t<li data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1807\"><strong data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1805\">One full album sale</strong></li>\n \t<li data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1855\"><strong data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1853\">10 individual track sales from an album</strong></li>\n \t<li data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1927\"><strong data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1925\">3,750 ad-supported or 1,250 paid/subscription on-demand streams</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"2069\">With <em data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1955\">$ome $exy $ongs 4 U</em>, Drake continues to expand his influence, proving that his partnership with PARTYNEXTDOOR is a winning formula.</p>\n\n<h3 data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2122\"><strong data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2120\">Drake’s No. 1 Albums on the Billboard 200</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2195\">Here’s a look at all <strong data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2150\">14</strong> of Drake’s <strong data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2179\">Billboard 200</strong> No. 1 albums:</p>\n\n<table data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2982\">\n<thead data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2237\">\n<tr data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2237\">\n<th data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2205\">Album</th>\n<th data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2217\">Peak Date</th>\n<th data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2237\">Weeks at No. 1</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2982\">\n<tr data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2341\">\n<td><em data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2318\">Thank Me Later</em></td>\n<td>July 3, 2010</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2378\">\n<td><em data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2355\">Take Care</em></td>\n<td>Dec. 3, 2011</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2427\">\n<td><em data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2403\">Nothing Was the Same</em></td>\n<td>Oct. 12, 2013</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2492\">\n<td><em data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2468\">If You’re Reading This It’s Too Late</em></td>\n<td>Feb. 28, 2015</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2558\">\n<td><em data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2520\">What a Time To Be Alive</em> (with Future)</td>\n<td>Oct. 10, 2015</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2592\">\n<td><em data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2568\">Views</em></td>\n<td>May 21, 2016</td>\n<td>13</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2630\">\n<td><em data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2606\">More Life</em></td>\n<td>April 8, 2017</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2667\">\n<td><em data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2643\">Scorpion</em></td>\n<td>July 14, 2018</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2708\">\n<td><em data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2684\">Care Package</em></td>\n<td>Aug. 17, 2019</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2757\">\n<td><em data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2732\">Certified Lover Boy</em></td>\n<td>Sept. 18, 2021</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2804\">\n<td><em data-start=\"2760\" data-end=\"2781\">Honestly, Nevermind</em></td>\n<td>July 2, 2022</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2858\">\n<td><em data-start=\"2807\" data-end=\"2817\">Her Loss</em> (with 21 Savage)</td>\n<td>Nov. 19, 2022</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2903\">\n<td><em data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2879\">For All the Dogs</em></td>\n<td>Oct. 21, 2023</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2982\">\n<td><em data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"2927\">$ome $exy $ongs 4 U</em> (with PARTYNEXTDOOR)</td>\n<td>March 1, 2025</td>\n<td>1 (to date)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3124\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">With <em data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3010\">$ome $exy $ongs 4 U</em> already making history, it raises the question—<strong data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3124\" data-is-last-node=\"\">how long until Drake claims the all-time Billboard 200 throne?</strong></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\"></div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"md:pt-0 dark:border-white/20 md:border-transparent md:dark:border-transparent w-full isolate has-[[data-has-thread-error]]:[box-shadow:var(--sharp-edge-bottom-shadow)] has-[[data-has-thread-error]]:pt-2\">\n<div class=\"m-auto text-base px-3 md:px-4 w-full md:px-5 lg:px-4 xl:px-5\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 md:max-w-3xl lg:max-w-[40rem] xl:max-w-[48rem]\">\n<div class=\"flex justify-cent